%% Conceptual explanation, not runtime output
flowchart TD
 N0["Before installation / Verify the chosen archive and use a fresh local guest"]
 N1["Before enrollment / Read the scope; admit only the selected fixture"]
 N2["During observation / Inspect unit evidence and its age; assess the cause"]
 N3["When requesting action / Provide a preparation identity and run the native steps"]
 N4["After the action / Inspect fresh evidence and the completed attempt"]
 N5["If interrupted / Preserve records and reconcile before trying again"]
 N0 --> N1
 N1 --> N2
 N2 --> N3
 N3 --> N4
 N4 --> N5
